ipal Council, told sources that complaints over night-time construction noise reach him daily. He said builders who break the rules should face proposed fines of up to BD5,000. He named Blocks 914 and 934 among areas where residents have complained and proposed limiting noisy work in housing areas to 6 a.m. to noon and 4 p.m. to 6 p.m. \u2018Every day I receive complaints,\u2019 Mr Abdul Latif said. \u2018Students and employees need to sleep, and this affects the quality of their work.\u2019 He said drilling, breaking concrete, heavy machinery use, and roadworks late at night leave families struggling to rest. Some asphalting is carried out around 1am to avoid traffic, he said, but the noise from machinery can still carry into nearby homes. Mr Abdul Latif said the strain is especially hard on older people, patients and workers returning home tired after night shifts. He wants construction permits to specify exactly when work can take place, with separate hours where needed during the summer and the same rules [...]", "content": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PAID PLANS", "keywords": ["bahrain"], "creator": ["author"], "language": "english", "country": ["saudi arabia", "bahrain", "united arab emirates", "kuwait", "qatar"], "category": ["top", "politics"], "datatype": "blog", "pubDate": "2026-08-31 07:55:42", "pubDateTZ": "UTC", "fetched_at": "2026-08-31 08:10:03", "image_url": "https://www.gulf-insider.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/A_3UZgtQmwEG_2026-08-30_1788095609resized_pic.jpg", "video_url": null, "source_id": "gulf_insider", "source_name": "Gulf Insider", "source_priority": 101027, "source_url": "https://www.gulf-insider.com", "source_icon": "https://n.bytvi.com/gulf_insider.png", "sentiment": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PROFESSIONAL AND CORPORATE PLANS", "sentiment_stats": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PROFESSIONAL AND CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_tag": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN PROFESSIONAL AND CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_region": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN CORPORATE PLANS", "ai_org": "ONLY AVAILABLE IN CORPORATE PLAN